# Build context for web/Dockerfile.e2e. The context is the repo root because
# web/vite.config.ts reaches ../data — but the *image* copies only the two files
# below; everything else arrives at run time through the bind mount in
# web/docker-compose.e2e.yml. So the context can be almost empty, which matters:
# .git and web/node_modules are hundreds of megabytes between them.
*
!web/package.json
!web/package-lock.json
